{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16959","headline":"幕中诸公有观猎之作因继之 · 武元衡","name":"幕中诸公有观猎之作因继之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"刀州城北劒山东，甲士屯云骑散风。\n旌斾遍张林岭动，豺狼驱尽塞垣空。\n衔芦远雁愁萦缴，绕树啼猨怯避弓。\n爲报府中诸从事，燕然未勒莫论功。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武元衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16959.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16959","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}